.TH PROPOSE 1
.SH NAME
propose \- propose an amendment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B propose
.RB [ \-r
.IR FILE ]
.RB [ \-a
.IR FILE ]
.RI [ KEY = VALUE ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Proposes an amendment. Prints its ID.
.PP
One proposal per life. Requires group elder.
.PP
Takes effect when ratified. Lapses when not.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-r " FILE"
New text of
.IR /rule .
.TP
.BI \-a " FILE"
Argument.
.TP
.IB KEY = VALUE
New value of a parameter.
.SH FILES
/chapter/parameters, /chapter/proposals/
.SH SEE ALSO
testify(1), ratify(1)
